3408:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\basic_string.h ****        *  0 if their values are equivalent, or > 0 if this substring
3409:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\basic_string.h ****        *  is ordered after the string from @a __s.  Determines the
3410:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\basic_string.h ****        *  effective length rlen of the strings to compare as the
3411:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\basic_string.h ****        *  smallest of the length of the substring and @a __n2.  The
